{"sections":[{"slug":"Springer纤维","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Springer纤维"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Springer <span lang=\"zh\">纤维</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Springer 纤维"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Springer <span lang=\"zh\">纤维与</span> Schubert <span lang=\"zh\">簇有关</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">两者都是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/旗流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">旗流形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">的子簇</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是幂零矩阵</span>, <strong>Springer <span lang=\"zh\">纤维</span></strong> $\\mathcal B^X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/旗流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">旗流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中由所有被</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">保持的旗构成的子簇</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">一个旗</span> $V_\\bullet$ <span lang=\"zh\">被</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">保持是指</span> $XV_i\\subset V_i,i=0,\\cdots,n$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span></h3>\n<p>Springer <span lang=\"zh\">纤维的上同调带有自然的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">作用</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这是几何表示论的重要构造</span>.</p>\n<p>$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Jordan <span lang=\"zh\">分解给出了</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个划分</span> $\\lambda$, <span lang=\"zh\">而</span> Springer <span lang=\"zh\">证明了</span> $\\mathcal B^X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的最高维上同调是</span> $\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> $S_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的不可约表示</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称群的表示","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称群的表示</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}